   "t": "A rival restaurant owner called Mark visits Claude Monet, and the owner, Nagiyev, welcomes him with a smile. The two men trade friendly insults about their head chefs, and then Nagiyev tells Vika to bring out the hot dishes. Here's the Russian first.",
